        {
          "es": "En una de las versiones, Kupe quería a Kuramārōtini.",
          "en": "In one version, Kupe loved a woman named Kuramārōtini."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero ella era la esposa de su primo, Hoturapa.",
          "en": "But she was the wife of his cousin, Hoturapa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kupe la quería para él, y armó un plan cruel.",
          "en": "Kupe wanted her for himself, and he made a cruel plan."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un día, Kupe invitó a Hoturapa a pescar con él en el mar.",
          "en": "One day, Kupe invited Hoturapa to go fishing with him out at sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hoturapa confiaba en su primo, y dijo que sí.",
          "en": "Hoturapa trusted his cousin, and said yes."
        }
