        {
          "es": "Otra parte de la historia habla de un pulpo gigante.",
          "en": "Another part of the story tells of a giant octopus."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pertenecía a un hombre llamado Muturangi.",
          "en": "It belonged to a man named Muturangi."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se llamaba Te Wheke-a-Muturangi: el pulpo de Muturangi.",
          "en": "It was called Te Wheke-a-Muturangi: the octopus of Muturangi."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era enorme, y siempre tenía hambre.",
          "en": "It was enormous, and it was always hungry."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus brazos largos llegaban muy lejos, por debajo de las canoas. Nadie podía detenerlo.",
          "en": "Its long arms could reach far beneath the canoes. Nobody could stop it."
        }
